wn as JW202/DQ form) will be generated digitally from the online system and sent via email. Please pay attention to emails with sender's address ending in cscsc.edu.cn. You will need to print out both documents for visa application.\n3. If you need on-campus accommodation or airport pick-up, please register and log in to the \"BNU International Student Service System\" to make reservation. The date starts from July 1st, 2026. Please see s sytem registration instruction here:\nhttps://iso.bnu.edu.cn/cn/download/download?id=114\n* If your scholarship package includes on-campus accommodation, the dorm will be assigned by the university and you do not need to make reservation.\nPlease do not hesitate to send emails to isp@bnu.edu.cn if you have any questions or concerns.\nBNU International Students Office\nRecommend\nJULY 2026 GRADUATION NOTICE FOR INTERNATIONAL GRADUATE STUDENTS\nANNOUNCEMENT OF 2026-2027 ACADEMIC YEAR CSC ANNUAL REVIEW RESULTS\nANNOUNCEMENT OF BEIJING NORMAL UNIVERSITY 2026-2027 ACADEMIC YEAR ANNUAL REVIEW RESULTS OF VARIOUS SCHOLARSHIPS\nANNOUNCEMENT OF THE 2026-2027 ACADEMIC YEAR RESULT FOR BEIJING GOVERNMENT SCHOLARSHIP (CURRENT STUDENT)\nANNOUNCEMENT OF 2026 EXCELLENT INTERNATIONAL GRADUATES (DEGREE STUDENTS)\nAbout us\nAbout Beijing\nAbout BNU\nAbout ISO\nFamous Professors\nStudy & Life\nOrientation\nStudents Association\nFacilities\nInternship & Employment\nCopyright © 2016 Beijing Normal University. All rights reserved\nTechnical Support:\nCUCAS"
